90
00:06:50.289 --> 00:06:51.569
Grocery platform:

91
00:06:51.849 --> 00:06:55.455
OrderPlaced, StockReserved, SlotBooked, OrderDispatched.

92
00:06:55.735 --> 00:06:57.612
